From 2158f8216738140aa33ea5d48c22ea580648f0fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blazerpaul15 <blazerpaul15@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 09:48:51 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] healthd-ext: Report OPlus fast charge power

OPlus UFCS/PPS fast charging exposes the real negotiated power through
oplus_chg common nodes, while the generic health values can report
battery-side current/voltage and make SystemUI show a much lower
lockscreen wattage.

Override maxChargingCurrentMicroamps and maxChargingVoltageMicrovolts
from the OPlus power nodes when available, using USB input voltage and
power in milliwatts to derive the framework charging current.

This lets BatteryService and SystemUI display the correct fast charging
wattage on supported OPlus devices.

Change-Id: I3dfd57c0e60f685edb57c77e1c9fce25d584566b
---
 aidl/main.cpp | 68 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 67 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/aidl/main.cpp b/aidl/main.cpp
index 995e1aa..663ee2a 100644
